OL,3,AE-bike battery in fatal fire had
OL,4,Arepairs - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn e-bike battery linked to a fire
OL,7,Fwhich killed a mother and two children
OL,8,Fhad issues prior to the blaze, an
OL,9,Finquest has heard.
OL,11,FGemma Germeney, 31, and children Lilly,
OL,12,Feight, and Oliver, four, lost their
OL,13,Flives in the fire on Sackville Close in
OL,14,FCambridge on 30 June 2023. The
OL,15,Fchildren's father, Scott Peden,
OL,16,Fsurvived.
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,19,Fsaid at the time the most probable
OL,20,Fcause of the fire was an e-bike that
OL,21,Fwas charging.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
